First, ensure MongoDB Database Tools (mongodump, mongorestore) are installed and the required Atlas network access and permissions are configured.

For Backup:
mongodump \
  --uri="" \
  --archive=archivename.gz \
  --gzip

For Restore:
mongorestore \
  --uri="" \
  --archive=archivename.gz \
  --gzip

For Restore & Replace Existing Data:
mongorestore \ 
  --uri="<mongodb-atlas-uri>" \ 
  --archive=backup.gz \ 
  --gzip \ 
  --drop

--drop removes existing collections before restoring them.
